<table  width="100%" border=2 bordercolor="white" bordercolordark="white" bordercolorlight="white" cellpadding=3><tr>	<td><FONT face="Arial" size="2"><BR><B><U>Xan Boys T4C Site</U></B><br> <small>-<b>Shane</b> : <FONT face="Arial" size="2" color="black"><font color="#ffffff">Friday, October 13, 2000</small><br><br><FONT face="Arial" size="2" color="black"><b><u>Xan Boys T4C Site</b></u><br>I was emailed a new T4C site today and I was quite impressed with it, so be sure to go and check out the <a href="http://xant4c.virtualave.net">Xan Boys T4C Site</a>.<br> <font size="-1"></td></tr></table><br>
